{"code":"045060","name":"오공","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"화학","sector_desc":"석유화학·정밀화학·2차전지 소재 등. 유가, 중국 수요, 스프레드(제품가−원료가)가 실적을 좌우합니다.","desc":"동사는 1962년 설립되어 2000년 코스닥 상장하며, 오공티에스와 삼성테이프 등 2개의 종속회사를 보유하고 있음. 접착제 및 테이프 등 화학제품 제조 판매업을 영위하며, 주요 제품에는 초산비닐수지에멀젼 접착제, 핫멜트접착제, 점착테이프, 순간접착제 등이 있음. 초산비닐수지에멀젼접착제는 친환경 인증을 받으며 시장 확대 중이고, 핫멜트접착제는 자동차품질 인증을 통해 전자 및 자동차 분야로 사업을 확장하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-26","n_days":298,"close":2055.0,"open":2065.0,"high":2065.0,"low":2050.0,"volume":10415,"amount":21402825.0,"ret_1d":-0.2427,"gap":0.2427,"range_pct":0.7299,"ret_5":-1.4388,"ret_20":-1.4388,"ret_60":-6.8027,"ret_120":-16.6329,"ret_250":-15.6057,"ma20":2085.0,"ma60":2109.9167,"ma120":2156.575,"ma200":2226.42,"close_vs_ma200":-7.6994,"close_vs_ma60":-2.6028,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":-10.6321,"r2_60":0.2334,"slope_120":-17.7197,"r2_120":0.306,"slope_250":-13.5334,"r2_250":0.5634,"high52":2560.0,"low52":1951.0,"pos_52w":17.0772,"dd_52w":-19.7266,"mdd_1y":-21.3121,"atr14_pct":2.659,"vol_ann_60":26.1806,"vol_avg20":20118.95,"vol_ratio20":0.5177,"vr5":0.4911,"vr20":0.3821,"amount_avg5":25470461.0,"amount_avg20":42028253.25,"amount_avg60":53667506.8333,"obv_chg20":19.8497,"turnover_20":2.375,"pv_eff_20":-0.6058,"rsi14":42.9247,"frgn_net_5":-1451.0,"inst_net_5":7744.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":-0.0086,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0457,"smart_net_5_pct":0.0371,"frgn_net_20":5116.0,"inst_net_20":19169.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":0.0302,"inst_net_20_pct":0.1131,"smart_net_20_pct":0.1433,"frgn_net_60":87134.0,"inst_net_60":64492.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":0.5143,"inst_net_60_pct":0.3807,"smart_net_60_pct":0.895,"frgn_net_120":401109.0,"inst_net_120":27301.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":2.3675,"inst_net_120_pct":0.1611,"smart_net_120_pct":2.5287,"foreign_ratio":3.48,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":-0.25,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":49.0,"op_margin_q":10.8168,"op_qoq":206.25,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":250.0,"rev_yoy":11.5764,"op_trend_4q":36.8,"fin_period":"202606","roe":7.21,"debt_ratio":19.12,"per":3.95,"pbr":